            <ArticleTitle>Acute renal artery embolism: a case report and brief literature review.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>145-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Acute renal artery embolism is an uncommon clinical diagnosis. We present a case report of a patient who was treated with transcatheter thrombolysis and a literature review and discussion of this condition and its management.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
